  "question": {
    "text": "Distance between object and its image $\\left( \\text{magnified by } -\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$ is 30 cm. The focal length of the mirror used is $\\left(\\frac{x}{4}\\right) \\mathrm{cm}$,<br/>where magnitude of value of $x$ is _________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "45",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & M=-\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ & -\\frac{-V}{-U}=\\frac{-1}{3} \\Rightarrow V=\\frac{U}{3}\\end{aligned}$<br/>Distance $b / w$ object and image :<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/rw7pm5hcaJVSCCJLALU2kzE7W8km71NfoVzaEs3PS6c.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{U}-\\mathrm{V}=30 \\\\ & \\mathrm{U}-\\frac{\\mu}{3}=30 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{U}=45 \\quad \\mathrm{~V}=15 \\\\ & \\frac{1}{\\mathrm{f}}=\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{~V}}+\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{U}}=-\\frac{1}{15}-\\frac{1}{45} \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{~F}=\\frac{45}{4} \\\\ & \\mathrm{x}=45\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
